{
  "Name": "ScheduledSearch - Okta - Identity Access Management - Lifecycle - System API - Attempt to Revoke Okta API Token",
  "Description": "Identifies attempts to revoke an Okta API token. An adversary may attempt to revoke or delete an Okta API token to disrupt an organization's business operations.\n\nReference(s):\n- https://detection.fyi/elastic/detection-rules/integrations/okta/impact_attempt_to_revoke_okta_api_token/\n- https://github.com/elastic/detection-rules/tree/main/rules/integrations/okta/impact_attempt_to_revoke_okta_api_token.toml",
